36259	Ville Sakari Peltonen  is a Finnish ice hockey coach and a former professional ice hockey forward. He is serving as assistant to head coach Kari Jalonen at SC Bern. Peltonen was drafted by the San Jose Sharks as their third round pick, 58th overall, in the 1993 NHL Entry Draft. During his professional career, he has played 382 NHL games for Sharks, Nashville Predators and Florida Panthers.
