15723	The Italian People's Party  was a Christian democratic, centrist, and progressive Catholic political party in Italy. The successor of Christian Democracy, the PPI was a member of the European People's Party. In December 2002 the PPI merged into Democracy is Freedom – The Daisy, later which formed the Democratic Party in 2007.
