36424	Pin Ups is the seventh studio album by David Bowie, containing cover versions of songs, released in 1973 on RCA Records. Pin Ups entered the UK chart on 3 November 1973  and stayed there for 21 weeks, peaking at No. 1. It re-entered the chart on 30 April 1983, this time for fifteen weeks, peaking at No. 57. In July 1990, it again entered the chart, for one week, at No. 52. The cover image shows Bowie with supermodel Twiggy.
